# Project Changes Log

## Banner Management Feature & Route Fix (2026-10-19)

### Changes Made:
1. **Simplified Admin Banner Form (`src/app/admin/banners/page.js`)**:
   - Removed subtitle, destination link, and display-order input fields.
   - Streamlined the form to accept only **Banner Name** (`title`) and **Banner Image** (`image`).
   - Added support for single and multiple image selection/upload in a single operation with file validation (JPG, PNG, WebP, AVIF up to 10 MB).
   - Automatically generated numbered banner names (e.g., `Summer Sale 1`, `Summer Sale 2`, etc.) when a single common title is provided for multiple uploaded images.
   - Provided instant previews with remove controls for selected files before upload.

2. **Automatic Slideshow Ordering & Backend Integration (`server/api.js`)**:
   - Fixed backend API route handling and validated data structures for banners.
   - Assigned automatic ordering (`order`) for newly created banners.
   - Preserved active/inactive toggling, deletion with Cloudinary asset cleanup, and seamless homepage slideshow integration (`src/components/home/BannerSlideshow.js`).

3. **Tracking File**:
   - Created `project_change_name` to document changes made per prompt.
